Closeout record: end the final reply of a turn that changed files or ran commands with this block. A turn that only answered needs none; one ending with an optional question or offer writes Status done with no Missing.

<closeout …>

Merged and Deployed: yes only if this exact change is merged or running in production, else no, or n/a; a false yes is worse. Did: up to three sentences. Artifact: one per line; a file for the user is `file <absolute path>`. Verified: what you ran and its reading, or untested. Status: done when every criterion is met; what lies outside them goes in Missing. Missing: only what someone else must supply. Blocked: name who or what in Waiting. Write it in English.